{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:06 2026-07-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:06 2026-07-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:06 2026-07-01 HKT</p><p>今(1日)下午2時51分，一名男子報案指在旺角塘尾道22號長輝大廈10樓一單位內，其兩名友人爭執打架，其中一人用較剪插向對方，傷者當場倒地不起，昏迷被送往廣華醫院，經搶救後延至下午3時46分不治，警方正調查事件。</p><p>報案男子制服施襲者時亦告受傷，被送院敷治。現場警員持盾牌登樓，稍後大批刑事部探員亦到場調查。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e3978dba109468999ab104f2da89594/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_16_02_33.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/245e62a8f0fda31234fac45b15c06b29/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_16_02_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批刑事探員到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e48d6cb458053160e47a71c3f9fb3a7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_16_05_08_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2487254483b170d65b8fc43ac1440013/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_15_59_39_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/990b51bd8502662a3d2f9a488cade271/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_15_59_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99fec43cd96e19225d28fd0cff58434a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_15_59_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員持盾牌到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1514476db43bebae4831e78e46d2a6f9/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-01_at_15_59_38.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-01T08:35:17.445049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}